{"content":[{"c":["MAACATHITE, MAACHATHI*, MAACHATHITE*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["People of Maacah who held the territory neighboring the Geshurites and the boundary of land granted to the half-tribe of Manasseh (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.3.14","r":"Deut.3.14","rawR":"Deut.3.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.3.14","value":"Deut.3.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 3:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.12.5","r":"Josh.12.5","rawR":"Josh.12.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.12.5","value":"Josh.12.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 12:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.11","r":"Josh.13.11","rawR":"Josh.13.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.11","value":"Josh.13.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"13:11"},"). It was taken over by Jair, who with his companions were unable to dislodge the Maacathites and Geshurites living among them (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.13","r":"Josh.13.13","rawR":"Josh.13.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.13","value":"Josh.13.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["From the Maacathites came Eliphelet, who joined David’s army of “mighty men” (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.34","r":"2Sam.23.34","rawR":"2Sam.23.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.34","value":"2Sam.23.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:34"},"). The parallel passage in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.36","r":"1Chr.11.36","rawR":"1Chr.11.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.36","value":"1Chr.11.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 11:36"}," calls him a Mekerathite."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":["Their unfriendliness persisted throughout Israel’s history. When Jerusalem fell to Nebuchadnezzar, Jaazaniah, the son of a Maacathite, sought to join Ishmael the Ammonite against Gedaliah, whom Nebuchadnezzar had left to govern the city (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.25.23","r":"2Kgs.25.23","rawR":"2Kgs.25.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.25.23","value":"2Kgs.25.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 25:23"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.40.8","r":"Jer.40.8","rawR":"Jer.40.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.40.8","value":"Jer.40.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 40:8"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=MaacahMaachahPlace_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"MaacahMaachahPlace_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"MaacahMaachahPlace_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Maacah, Maachah (Place)"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"MaacathiteMaachathiMaachathite","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Dt 3:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.3.14","rawQueryValue":"Deut.3.14","sourceRefExact":"Deut.3.14"},{"anchorText":"Jos 12:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.12.5","rawQueryValue":"Josh.12.5","sourceRefExact":"Josh.12.5"},{"anchorText":"13:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.11","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.11","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.11"},{"anchorText":"Jos 13:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.13","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.13","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.13"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.34","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.34","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.34"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 11:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.36","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.36","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.36"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 25:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.25.23","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.25.23","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.25.23"},{"anchorText":"Jer 40:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.40.8","rawQueryValue":"Jer.40.8","sourceRefExact":"Jer.40.8"}